WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:01.620
If you don't have a lot of room in your house

00:00:01.621 --> 00:00:02.781
and you've got a baby coming,

00:00:02.782 --> 00:00:04.261
you need to see this. This is Jewel,

00:00:04.262 --> 00:00:06.141
Baby's folding bathtub. And it. Seriously,

00:00:06.142 --> 00:00:07.701
