00:00:21.782 --> 00:00:24.981
No giant baby bathtub permanently sitting on the bathroom floor.

00:00:24.982 --> 00:00:26.461
And because it folds so small,

00:00:26.462 --> 00:00:28.421
it's actually something I can bring with us when we travel.

00:00:28.422 --> 00:00:30.221
I grabbed mine, what was discarded on here.

00:00:30.222 --> 00:00:33.181
